widgets_values:
• Core Elements: Subject (a young woman with translucent wings) + Scene (a magical forest at dawn, moss-covered stones + unopened flower buds) + Action (reaching out to cast a spell / petals blooming)

• Aesthetic Controls: Light Source (morning light, soft light), Light Type (rim light, outlining the fairy's wings), Camera Size (medium to close-up), Composition (central composition), Color Tone (warm tones, pale pinkish-white petals + reflections of wings)

• 5-Second Action Breakdown:

0-2 seconds: She crouches before a flower bud, palms facing the bud, her hands emitting a faint green light;

2-4 seconds: The flower bud slowly blooms from the top, pink petals curling upwards to reveal yellow stamens;

4-5 seconds: Dewdrops on the petals reflect the morning light, she gently touches the stamens, her wings fluttering softly.
